{%- comment -%}
  Page header image — one component, six pages.

  Params:
    section  (required) — the calling section, for its settings
    ratio    optional   — CSS aspect-ratio, defaults to the section setting

  Editable from the theme editor on every page that renders it: upload via
  Header image, or paste a CDN URL into Header image URL when the asset lives
  outside the theme's own files. The picker wins if both are set.

  When neither is set it draws a PLACEHOLDER rather than nothing. That is
  deliberate — Aaron asked for a visible reminder to change it, and an empty
  header looks finished, which is how a missing image survives to launch. The
  placeholder names the exact setting to change, so whoever opens the editor
  does not have to go looking.

  Monochrome, Helvetica and JetBrains Mono only — the placeholder obeys the
  brand rules like anything else that can end up in front of someone.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign img = section.settings.header_image
  assign img_url = section.settings.header_image_url
  assign alt = section.settings.header_image_alt | default: section.settings.heading | default: page.title
  assign ar = ratio | default: section.settings.header_image_ratio | default: '21 / 9'
-%}

{%- if section.settings.show_header_image -%}
  <div class="non-pagehead-media" style="--non-pagehead-ar: {{ ar }}">
    {%- if img != blank -%}
      {{
        img
        | image_url: width: 2400, format: 'webp'
        | image_tag:
          loading: 'lazy',
          widths: '600,900,1200,1800,2400',
          sizes: '100vw',
          class: 'non-pagehead-media__img',
          alt: alt
      }}
    {%- elsif img_url != blank -%}
      <img
        class="non-pagehead-media__img"
        src="{{ img_url }}"
        alt="{{ alt | escape }}"
        loading="lazy">
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="non-pagehead-media__ph">
        <span class="non-mono non-pagehead-media__phlabel">Placeholder — replace before launch</span>
        <span class="non-pagehead-media__phhint">
          Theme editor &rarr; {{ section.settings.heading | default: page.title | default: 'this section' }} &rarr; Header image.
          Landscape, 2400px wide or more.
        </span>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
